@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Refresh global PHP profiles automatically.** Changing the global PHP version or extension selection updates completion and diagnostics while preserving unsaved files. Closing the service also cancels pending client requests safely. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Retire diagnostics before replacing project services.** Previously accepted diagnostic sends finish queuing before project retirement, preventing old service publications from crossing the replacement boundary. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Recognize transitive Laravel installations.** Framework discovery reads Composer installed metadata and resolves framework configuration from its declared install path, including custom vendor locations. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
