@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Local Tower-LSP cancellation patch
+
+Upstream: tower-lsp 0.20.0, installed crates.io source. Original registry checksum: `d4ba052b54a6627628d9b3c34c176e7eda8359b7da9acd497b9f20998d118508`. `UPSTREAM-INVENTORY.json` records actual preimage file hashes, not an invented Cargo checksum manifest.
+
+License selected: MIT. Original LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE are retained, including Copyright (c) 2023 Eyal Kalderon.
+
+Only src/service/client/pending.rs is modified: cancelled response futures remove their exact registration; late replies and cancellation during delivery do not panic; senders are dropped outside map guards. Tests cover unpolled/polled cancellation, exact duplicate-ID FIFO slots, repeated cancellation and the delivery race. An explicit equivalent Debug implementation reads the waiter count without the upstream dead-code warning.
+
+This does not change the existing contract when an independent future is awaited after the entire Pending map is destroyed, or distinguish intentionally reused request IDs.
